# Prowcatcher Specialist (2/1 haste, "Exhaust - {3}{R}: Put two +1/+1 counters on this creature"): cast on turn 1 off the Mountain and
# Mox Ruby, it leaves only three non-red mana, so the exhaust ability is not offered (too little, and no red). On turn 3 Bot1 pays
# exactly {3}{R} (Mountain and three Moxen, the pool empty after) and it becomes a 4/3; on turn 5, with every mana source untapped, the
# exhaust ability is not offered again (it can be activated only once).

